      "text": "What Stockmind does\nStockmind watches point-of-sale data from independent retailers and prepares purchase orders when stock cover falls below the cover target. It connects to Square, Lightspeed and Shopify POS.\nThe workflow\nStockmind works inside the purchase order preparation that the business already runs every week. Nothing about the existing process has to change first.\nPricing · About",
